      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "abstract",
          "quote": "the inclusion particles caused steep strain gradients during plastic deformations in Alloy 617, due to the dislocation pileups on the interphase boundaries. The distribution of strained area is orientation dependent and thus caused localized plastic deformations and early fractures in the transverse direction at low temperatures.",
